"Go straight to that big building," the woman said.
I thank her.
I walk straight.
Suddenly, I see the water.
This is Marine Drive!
I step onto the wide walkway.
There is a large backwater in front.
The month of February is a good time.
There is a good breeze here.
There are many people here.
They are enjoying the breeze.
Some walk to the left.
Some walk to the right.
I walk straight ahead.
Kochi is very beautiful.
I am very happy.
